{
  "$description": "Verdex Financial 3-tier --vx- design tokens (primitive -> semantic -> component). Four themes: light, dark, hc-light, hc-dark. A token whose value is null in a given theme is a LEGAL state meaning 'omit this property' (e.g. high-contrast themes replace shadow with border). Semantic and component tiers re-bind per theme; primitives are theme-constant. Component tokens resolve through a semantic token, which resolves through a primitive. This is the genuine Verdex DS resource; the engine reads it through the configured input path.",
